### Failed Test Analysis: test_7_task_data_storage

**Test Purpose**: 
This test verifies that task data is properly stored in the `tasks.txt` file when adding and removing tasks.

**Failure Details**:
```
AssertionError: '2023-12-31' not found in 'admin:Review code:2023-11-15:2\nuser1:Learn Flask:2023-10-20:3\nadmin:Test task description:202312-03-01:4\nadmin:File storage test task:202312-03-01:4\n'
