CLASS TaskManager  
    FUNCTION add_task(username, description, due_date)  
        IF username OR description OR due_date MISSING  
            RETURN False  
        ENDIF  

        APPEND new_task = {'username': username, 'description': description, 'due_date': due_date} TO tasks.txt  
        RETURN True  
    ENDFUNCTION  
ENDCLASS  
```
Key Libraries:  
- `flask.request.form` (retrieves form data)  

