CLASS FileStorage:
    FUNCTION write_task(username, description, due_date):
        task_id = LEN(ALL_TASKS) + 1
        APPEND username|description|due_date|task_id TO tasks.txt
        RETURN True

CLASS TaskManager:
    FUNCTION add_task(username, description, due_date):
        RETURN FileStorage.write_task(username, description, due_date)

ROUTE /home (POST):
    IF 'description' IN FORM:
        description = FORM['description']
        due_date = FORM['due_date']
        TaskManager.add_task(session['username'], description, due_date)
    REDIRECT /home
```
Key Libraries:  
- Flask (`request`) – Retrieves form data for task creation.  

